{"version":1,"key":"card:461","content":{"id":461,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在进行迭代时时，除了需要迭代的值本身，还需要索引信息，这个时候可以使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"enumerate()","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 函数"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"基本语法："}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"enumerate(iterable, start=0)","language":"py","uuid":"2ccda379-0a03-4e96-8a68-3179d845878d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"iterable","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：要枚举的可迭代对象，如列表、元组等"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"start","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：可选参数，用于指定起始的索引值，默认为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"0","code":true}]}]}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"fruits = ['apple', 'banana', 'cherry']\nfor index, fruit in enumerate(fruits):\n    print(index, fruit)\n\n0 apple\n1 banana\n2 cherry","language":"py","uuid":"b8c1e492-1635-409e-ac0e-0062c4edb769","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"colors = ['red', 'green', 'blue']\nfor index, color in enumerate(colors, start=1):\n    print(index, color)\n\n1 red\n2 green\n3 blue","language":"py","uuid":"a1568b8e-491c-4da2-8e42-f005f0f7b575","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["Python/enumerate"],"createTime":1719204611818,"updateTime":1743303640441,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640441}}